  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"SVELTE_HYDRATER contents\" data-target=\"RepoCodeCopy\" data-props=\"{}\">\n   <!---->\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\">\n   <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog\" class=\"text-gray-500! no-underline! hover:underline! flex items-center font-sans\"><!----> Back to Articles</a>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-base\">\n    <!--[0-->\n    <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog\" class=\"flex items-center gap-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 font-sans text-sm font-semibold no-underline bg-purple-500/10 hover:bg-purple-500/20\"><!--[0--><span class=\"bg-linear-to-br inline-block -skew-x-12 whitespace-nowrap border border-gray-200 from-gray-800 to-gray-900 font-sans font-semibold leading-none text-white will-change-transform dark:from-gray-50 dark:to-gray-100 dark:text-gray-900 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs \"><!--[0--><span>Team</span><!--]--></span><!----> <span>Article</span><!--]--></a><!--]-->\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-4\">\n     <!--[0-->\n     <span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm sm:text-base\">Published October 13, 2026</span><!--]-->\n     <!--[-1-->\n     <!--]-->\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--[-1-->\n   <!--]-->\n  </div>\n  <!---->\n  <div class=\"not-prose mb-6 font-sans xl:hidden\">\n   <div class=\"SVELTE_HYDRATER contents\" data-target=\"UpvoteControl\" data-props=\"{&quot;modalClassNames&quot;:&quot;not-prose&quot;,&quot;maxShown&quot;:6,&quot;apiUrlPrefix&quot;:&quot;/api/blog/LiquidAI/lfm25-24b-a2b&quot;,&quot;postLoginRedirectUrl&quot;:&quot;/blog/LiquidAI/lfm25-24b-a2b&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;sm&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;horizontal&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;gray&quot;,&quot;upvotedColor&quot;:&quot;orange&quot;,&quot;upvoted&quot;:false,&quot;upvoters&quot;:[{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;61b8e2ba285851687028d395&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/61b8e2ba285851687028d395/Rq3xWG7mJ3aCRoBsq340h.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:true,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Maxime Labonne&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:&quot;mlabonne&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;},{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;66a7d924809a6e1e87b1ca01&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;/avatars/10d430cbd6ce90b0f2a9dc0c8f6440d3.svg&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Tim Seyde&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:&quot;tseyde&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;},{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;6ace5d7c25960ec94b12222a&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;/avatars/69c7697f87abffca0b1c9ac3098479c9.svg&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;James Corrigan&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:&quot;jcorrigan&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;},{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;644249b08443bce4c9890a0f&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;/avatars/33af1a607a8bf7780b98d6f70ea19999.svg&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Leonie Monigatti&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:&quot;iamleonie&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;},{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;69a5cba5ee290d6bb49457b8&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/no-auth/yu32gPCVLqnpeQd_MMZ74.png&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Darrow O'Lykos&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:&quot;darrowoflykos&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;},{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;66a734f138fbd9075584e7bd&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66a734f138fbd9075584e7bd/7GQOdyESC-_S73HVN-1MP.png&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Sinoué GAD&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:&quot;GAD-cell&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;},{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;68eb91c073c6cfe0f1e078c2&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/noauth/KEF9e8lF2ql0WQhNCIUKr.png&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Vadim HEMZELLEC-DAVIDSON&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:&quot;vemz&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;}],&quot;upvotes&quot;:7}\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-1  z-1 lg:sticky lg:top-8\">\n     <!--[0-->\n     <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/login?next=%2Fblog%2FLiquidAI%2Flfm25-24b-a2b\" class=\"self-start\"><!--[0--><!----> \n      <div role=\"checkbox\" class=\"shadow-alternate group flex h-9 cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border pl-3 pr-3.5 border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-850 \">\n       <!---->\n       Upvote\n       <div class=\"font-semibold text-orange-500\">7</div>\n       <!---->\n      </div> \n      <!----><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></a><!--]-->\n     <!--[0-->\n     <!--[0-->\n     <ul class=\"flex items-center text-gray-600  flex-row  text-base   \">\n      <!--[-->\n      <li class=\"  -mr-2 h-5 w-5 md:h-6 md:w-6   bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 \" title=\"mlabonne\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/mlabonne\" title=\"mlabonne\"><img class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/61b8e2ba285851687028d395/Rq3xWG7mJ3aCRoBsq340h.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><!--]--></li>\n      <li class=\"  -mr-2 h-5 w-5 md:h-6 md:w-6   bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 \" title=\"tseyde\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tseyde\" title=\"tseyde\"><img class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://huggingface.co/avatars/10d430cbd6ce90b0f2a9dc0c8f6440d3.svg\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><!--]--></li>\n      <li class=\"  -mr-2 h-5 w-5 md:h-6 md:w-6   bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 \" title=\"jcorrigan\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/jcorrigan\" title=\"jcorrigan\"><img class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://huggingface.co/avatars/69c7697f87abffca0b1c9ac3098479c9.svg\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><!--]--></li>\n      <li class=\"  -mr-2 h-5 w-5 md:h-6 md:w-6   bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 \" title=\"iamleonie\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/iamleonie\" title=\"iamleonie\"><img class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://huggingface.co/avatars/33af1a607a8bf7780b98d6f70ea19999.svg\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><!--]--></li>\n      <li class=\"  -mr-2 h-5 w-5 md:h-6 md:w-6   bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 \" title=\"darrowoflykos\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/darrowoflykos\" title=\"darrowoflykos\"><img class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/no-auth/yu32gPCVLqnpeQd_MMZ74.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><!--]--></li>\n      <li class=\"  -mr-2 h-5 w-5 md:h-6 md:w-6   bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 \" title=\"GAD-cell\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/GAD-cell\" title=\"GAD-cell\"><img class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-full\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66a734f138fbd9075584e7bd/7GQOdyESC-_S73HVN-1MP.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><!--]--></li>\n      <!--]-->\n      <!--[0-->\n      <li class=\"text-xs hover:text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300 order-last ml-3\"><!--[--><!--[0--><button class=\"btn bg-linear-to-br -ml-3 translate-x-px rounded-full border-2 border-white px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs\">+1</button><!--]--><!--]--></li>\n      <!--]-->\n     </ul>\n     <!--]-->\n     <!--]-->\n    </div>\n    <!--[-1-->\n    <!--]-->\n    <dialog class=\"shadow-alternate z-40 mx-4 my-auto h-fit select-text overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white max-sm:max-w-[calc(100dvw-2rem)] sm:mx-auto lg:mt-26 md:portrait:mt-30 xl:mt-30 2xl:mt-32 w-full sm:w-96 max-w-[calc(100%-4rem)] text-base not-prose \"></dialog>\n    <!---->\n    <!---->\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!---->\n  <!--[-1-->\n  <!--]-->\n  <div class=\"relative overflow-clip [overflow-clip-margin:3rem] [&amp;&gt;:last-child]:mb-0\">\n   <!---->\n   <p><!--[--><!--[0--></p>\n   <!--]-->\n   <!--]-->\n   <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B\"><strong>LFM2.5-24B-A2B</strong></a> is a 24B-parameter reasoning model with just 2B active parameters, built for fast, private agents on-device. It thinks before it answers, calls tools, and works through multi-step tasks inside popular agent harnesses. Because only 2B parameters are active per token, each reasoning token is cheap, so you can run agents continuously on your own hardware.\n   <p></p>\n   <ul>\n    <li><strong>Best-in-class agent:</strong> Competitive with Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, a model with ~50% more total and active parameters, on agentic and tool-use tasks, scoring 48.09 on LiveClaw versus 38.19.</li>\n    <li><strong>Reasoning at MoE speed:</strong> Always thinks before it answers. With only 2B active parameters per token, each reasoning token is cheap.</li>\n    <li><strong>Efficient inference:</strong> 184 tok/s on an Apple M5 Max and up to 21K output tok/s on a single NVIDIA B300 GPU.</li>\n   </ul>\n   <p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-benchmark.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-benchmark.png\" alt=\"LFM2.5-24B-A2B-benchmark\"></a></p>\n   <h2 class=\"relative group flex items-baseline\"><a id=\"how-we-built-a-reasoning-agent-with-2b-active-parameters\" class=\"block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full\" href=\"#how-we-built-a-reasoning-agent-with-2b-active-parameters\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <span class=\"header-link\"></span> </a> <span> How we built a reasoning agent with 2B active parameters </span></h2>\n   <p>LFM2.5-24B-A2B builds on <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2-24B-A2B\">LFM2-24B-A2B</a> and keeps its architecture: 40 layers, 64 experts per MoE block with top-4 routing, and the same hybrid of gated short convolutions and GQA. The context window grows from 32K to 131K tokens, and an <a href=\"https://www.liquid.ai/blog/tokenizer-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">in-place tokenizer expansion</a> doubles the vocabulary from 65K to 128K tokens for better non-Latin tokenization. Unlike its predecessor, it is a reasoning-only model that produces an explicit chain of thought before its final answer.</p>\n   <p>Pre-training was scaled up from ~17T to ~33T tokens. Mid-training then adds 2T tokens at 32K context, weighted toward reasoning, math, code, instruction following, and multilingual text, and 300B tokens at 131K context, weighted toward long-context data. Tool calls and multi-turn trajectories appear throughout both phases. Post-training turns the base model into an agent in five stages:</p>\n   <ol>\n    <li><strong>Supervised fine-tuning (SFT)</strong></li>\n    <li><strong>Teacher specialization</strong></li>\n    <li><strong>Multi-domain on-policy distillation (MOPD), non-agentic:</strong> distill the specialist teachers on non-agentic tasks.</li>\n    <li><strong>MOPD, agentic:</strong> a second distillation stage focused on agentic tasks.</li>\n    <li><strong>Agentic reinforcement learning (Agentic RL):</strong> train the model inside agent harnesses, such as <a href=\"https://openclaw.ai\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenClaw</a>, <a href=\"https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hermes Agent</a>, <a href=\"https://pi.dev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pi</a>, and <a href=\"https://opencode.ai\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenCode</a>.</li>\n   </ol>\n   <p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Training-Recipe.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Training-Recipe.png\" alt=\"LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Training-Recipe\"></a></p>\n   <h2 class=\"relative group flex items-baseline\"><a id=\"benchmark-results\" class=\"block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full\" href=\"#benchmark-results\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <span class=\"header-link\"></span> </a> <span> Benchmark results </span></h2>\n   <p>We evaluated LFM2.5-24B-A2B against Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, Gemma-4-26B-A4B-it, and Nemotron-3.5-Lightning on 16 benchmarks covering tool use and agentic workflows, knowledge, instruction following, math, and coding. It is the smallest model in the group, yet it is competitive with MoEs with ~50% more total and active parameters.</p>\n   <div class=\"max-w-full overflow-auto\">\n    <table>\n     <thead>\n      <tr>\n       <th align=\"left\">Benchmark</th>\n       <th align=\"right\">LFM2.5-24B-A2B</th>\n       <th align=\"right\">Qwen3.6-35B-A3B</th>\n       <th align=\"right\">Gemma-4-26B-A4B-it</th>\n       <th align=\"right\">Nemotron-3.5-Lightning (30B-A3B)</th>\n      </tr>\n     </thead>\n     <tbody>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">AutomationBench</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>27.69</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">8.72</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">5.46</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">2.61</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">BFCLv4</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>65.01</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">65.00</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">57.09</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">53.78</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">ToolSandbox</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>80.71</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">75.02</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">72.09</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">75.13</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">LiveClaw</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>48.09</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">38.19</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">41.25</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">37.72</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">PinchBench</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">83.18</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>89.93</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">77.12</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">84.20</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">τ³-Bench Banking</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>8.04</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">7.63</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">4.54</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">7.01</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">WebArena Verified</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">26.75</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>37.62</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">25.62</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">28.69</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">GPQA Diamond</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">74.42</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>83.69</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">74.90</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">72.42</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">AA-Omniscience</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">-24.90</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">-24.35</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">-59.39</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>-3.58</strong></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">HLE</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">7.40</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">7.69</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>8.57</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">5.65</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">IFEval</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>96.75</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">93.06</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">92.00</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">94.19</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">IFBench</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>74.69</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">64.21</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">47.44</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">71.67</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">Multi-IF</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>84.38</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">81.53</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">82.19</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">82.34</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">MATH-500</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">96.04</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>96.73</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">95.66</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">96.40</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">SWE-Bench Verified (OpenCode)</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">51.00</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>66.20</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">25.80</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">53.40</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n       <td align=\"left\">SciCode</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">32.71</td>\n       <td align=\"right\"><strong>37.35</strong></td>\n       <td align=\"right\">35.42</td>\n       <td align=\"right\">27.78</td>\n      </tr>\n     </tbody>\n    </table>\n   </div>\n   <p>*All the models were evaluated with vLLM, using each benchmark's recommended generation parameters.</p>\n   <p>For your app, the strengths are tool use and instruction following. LFM2.5-24B-A2B leads or matches the competition on five of the eight tool-use and agentic benchmarks (AutomationBench, BFCLv4, ToolSandbox, LiveClaw, and τ³-Bench Banking), and on AutomationBench it scores more than three times the next-best model. It also leads on all three instruction-following benchmarks. Larger models keep an edge on knowledge-heavy benchmarks like GPQA Diamond, HLE, and AA-Omniscience, and on coding benchmarks like SWE-Bench Verified (OpenCode) and SciCode, so pair LFM2.5-24B-A2B with retrieval or web search for knowledge-heavy workloads.</p>\n   <p>These results make LFM2.5-24B-A2B a strong foundation for agents that need to reason, call tools, and run reliably on your device.</p>\n   <h2 class=\"relative group flex items-baseline\"><a id=\"inference-speed-on-cpu-and-gpu\" class=\"block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full\" href=\"#inference-speed-on-cpu-and-gpu\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <span class=\"header-link\"></span> </a> <span> Inference speed on CPU and GPU </span></h2>\n   <p>LFM2.5-24B-A2B ships with day-one support across the inference ecosystem, including llama.cpp, MLX, vLLM, SGLang, and ONNX.</p>\n   <p><strong>Edge inference.</strong> LFM2.5-24B-A2B is the fastest of the compared MoEs, decoding 184 tokens/s on an M5 Max and 114 tokens/s on a Ryzen AI Max+ 395. That is up to 1.7x faster than the next-best model, while using the least memory.</p>\n   <p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-edge-inference.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-edge-inference.png\" alt=\"LFM2.5-24B-A2B-edge-inference\"></a></p>\n   <p><strong>GPU inference.</strong> LFM2.5-24B-A2B is the fastest model in its size class, reaching over 21K output tokens per second at high concurrency on a single B300.</p>\n   <p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-gpu-inference.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B/resolve/main/figures/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-gpu-inference.png\" alt=\"LFM2.5-24B-A2B-gpu-inference\"></a></p>\n   <h2 class=\"relative group flex items-baseline\"><a id=\"how-to-use-lfm25-24b-a2b\" class=\"block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full\" href=\"#how-to-use-lfm25-24b-a2b\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <span class=\"header-link\"></span> </a> <span> How to use LFM2.5-24B-A2B </span></h2>\n   <p>Reach for LFM2.5-24B-A2B when you need agents that reason, call tools, and run reliably on your device.</p>\n   <p>Install the latest version of <code>transformers</code> (compatible with <code>transformers&gt;=5.0.0</code>):</p>\n   <pre><code class=\"language-sh\">pip install -U transformers\n</code></pre>\n   <p>Then load and run the model:</p>\n   <pre><code class=\"language-py\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> transformers <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, TextStreamer\n\nmodel_id = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B\"</span>\nmodel = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n    model_id,\n    device_map=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"auto\"</span>,\n    dtype=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"bfloat16\"</span>,\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">#   attn_implementation=\"flash_attention_2\" &lt;- uncomment on compatible GPU</span>\n)\ntokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_id)\nstreamer = TextStreamer(tokenizer, skip_prompt=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">True</span>, skip_special_tokens=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">True</span>)\n\nprompt = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"What is C. elegans?\"</span>\n\ninput_ids = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(\n    [{<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"role\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"user\"</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"content\"</span>: prompt}],\n    add_generation_prompt=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">True</span>,\n    return_tensors=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"pt\"</span>,\n    tokenize=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">True</span>,\n)[<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input_ids\"</span>].to(model.device)\n\noutput = model.generate(\n    input_ids,\n    do_sample=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">True</span>,\n    temperature=<span class=\"hljs-number\">0.1</span>,\n    top_k=<span class=\"hljs-number\">50</span>,\n    repetition_penalty=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1.05</span>,\n    max_new_tokens=<span class=\"hljs-number\">512</span>,\n    streamer=streamer,\n)\n</code></pre>\n   <h3 class=\"relative group flex items-baseline\"><a id=\"use-it-in-your-agent-harness\" class=\"block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full\" href=\"#use-it-in-your-agent-harness\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <span class=\"header-link\"></span> </a> <span> Use it in your agent harness </span></h3>\n   <p>Serve LFM2.5-24B-A2B locally behind any OpenAI-compatible backend, then point your agent harness at it. For example, with Hermes Agent:</p>\n   <pre><code class=\"language-sh\">hermes config <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">set</span> model.provider custom\nhermes config <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">set</span> model.base_url http://localhost:8080/v1\nhermes config <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">set</span> model.default LFM2.5-24B-A2B\nhermes config <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">set</span> model.context_length 131072\nhermes config <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">set</span> model.api_mode chat_completions\nhermes config <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">set</span> agent.tool_use_enforcement <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>\n</code></pre>\n   <p>The port depends on your serving backend: llama.cpp and MLX use <code>8080</code>, vLLM uses <code>8000</code>, SGLang uses <code>30000</code>, and LM Studio uses <code>1234</code>. See the <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B\">model card</a> for OpenClaw and Pi configs, and <a href=\"https://docs.liquid.ai/examples/agent-harnesses\" rel=\"nofollow\">our guide</a> for the full setup. Check out our <a href=\"https://www.liquid.ai/blog/lfm2-5-24b-a2b\" rel=\"nofollow\">release blog</a> for video examples.</p>\n   <h2 class=\"relative group flex items-baseline\"><a id=\"get-started-with-lfm25-24b-a2b\" class=\"block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full\" href=\"#get-started-with-lfm25-24b-a2b\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <span class=\"header-link\"></span> </a> <span> Get Started with LFM2.5-24B-A2B </span></h2>\n   <p>Both LFM2.5-24B-A2B and LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Base are open-weight and available on Hugging Face today:</p>\n   <ul>\n    <li><strong>Download:</strong> <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Base\">LFM2.5-24B-A2B-Base</a> and <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B\">LFM2.5-24B-A2B</a> on Hugging Face.</li>\n    <li><strong>Use in your harness:</strong> follow our <a href=\"https://docs.liquid.ai/examples/agent-harnesses\" rel=\"nofollow\">guide</a> on how to run a local agent, like OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, and Pi.</li>\n    <li><strong>Fine-tune:</strong> adapt LFM2.5-24B-A2B to your task with our <a href=\"https://github.com/Liquid4All/cookbook/tree/main/finetuning/notebooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">fine-tuning tutorials</a>.</li>\n   </ul>\n   <p>We can't wait to see what you build.</p>\n   <h2 class=\"relative group flex items-baseline\"><a id=\"citation\" class=\"block pr-1.5 text-lg md:absolute md:p-1.5 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:right-full\" href=\"#citation\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <span class=\"header-link\"></span> </a> <span> Citation </span></h2>\n   <p>If you use this work, please cite the release blog:</p>\n   <pre><code>@article{liquidAI202624BA2B,\n  author  = {Liquid AI},\n  title   = {LFM2.5-24B-A2B: Built for Fast On-Device Agents},\n  journal = {Liquid AI Blog},\n  year    = {2026},\n  note    = {www.liquid.ai/blog/lfm2-5-24b-a2b},\n}\n</code></pre>\n   <!---->\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Liquid AI 发布了 LFM2.5-24B-A2B，这是一款拥有 24B 参数但仅激活 2B 参数的 MoE 模型，专为快速且私有化的设备端智能体推理任务而优化。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Liquid AI 发布了 LFM2.5-24B-A2B，这是一款拥有 24B 参数但仅激活 2B 参数的 MoE 模型，专为快速且私有化的设备端智能体推理任务而优化。",
  "summary": "LFM2.5-24B-A2B 是一款专注于推理的混合专家（MoE）模型，专为高性能本地部署而设计。它拥有 24B 总参数，但每个 token 仅激活 2B 参数，在 Apple M5 Max 和 NVIDIA B300 等硬件上实现了惊人的推理速度。该模型支持 131K 上下文窗口，并通过了包括 SFT、领域特化和智能体强化学习在内的多阶段后训练方案，使其在工具使用和多步推理方面表现卓越。",
